- `bli-med.html` - Join meeting

### Index Page Redirect
Updated `index.html` to automatically redirect to `/oversikt.html` if the user is logged in with an email-based JWT token (the new user system).

### Tests
All 25 organization tests pass, confirming the navigation changes don't break existing functionality.
